    <div class="prose justify" style="margin-top:var(--space-4)">
      <p>We are <strong>Peru's first marine ecotourism operator</strong>: creators, drivers, promoters and defenders of the Palomino Islands — Callao. Over the years, this effort has let us witness the recovery of the ecosystem and of the various populations of seabirds and sea lions.</p>
      <p>Ecocruceros was born in La Punta, Callao, with a mission to bring people closer to Pacific marine wildlife — responsibly, safely and memorably.</p>
